# days on the coast, Cycle mode at a day an hour: the world runs by itself, days are counted, things happen and are
# logged, the flash is written rarely, and the sound is never silent or clipping (checked every 10 minutes, four
# world hours: the quiet hours before dawn included), and it all survives a restart
wait 300
tap PLAY
tap GLO
spin K1 1
spin K2 -4
tap HOME
peakreset
wait 600000
expect peak_db_max -0.3
expect peak_db_min -40
peakreset
wait 600000
expect peak_db_max -0.3
expect peak_db_min -40
peakreset
